    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual action game in which you compete with your rivals for the likability of children. Act appropriately as the amusement park mascot and become a superstar for the kids!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Physical Simulation</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The movements of the mascot characters are simulated by physical calculations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Customize</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can select playable character and costume.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Online Features</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online PvP and online cooperative play are supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the comical movements of the mascot characters simulated by physics.</p>",
